    "parrafos": [
      "This <strong>Porsche 911 Carrera Coupé</strong> from the 997.1 generation left the factory on <strong>29 March 2006</strong> in a particularly understated specification: black paint, code <strong>Z4 / C9Z</strong>, black leather interior and <strong>Tiptronic</strong> transmission.",
      "It keeps the clean, compact proportions that define the first 997: oval headlights, the classic fall of the tail and nothing added to spoil the Carrera's original lines. Silver five-spoke wheels, red brake calipers, the <strong>Carrera</strong> script on the tail and four exhaust outlets complete the picture. The instrument cluster reads <strong>113,244 km</strong>."
