    "parrafos": [
      "The 997.1 Carrera uses the naturally aspirated, water-cooled <strong>3.6-litre</strong> flat-six, mounted behind the rear axle as in every 911. On this car, the Porsche vehicle data sheet records engine code <strong>9605</strong> and transmission code <strong>A9701</strong>.",
      "The <strong>Tiptronic</strong> transmission (code 249) sets the car's character: smooth, comfortable driving in town, on long trips and every day, with the option of choosing the gears from the steering-wheel controls. It is the specification of a grand-touring 911, discreet and easy to live with."
    ],
